  "summary": "The Bazaar vault is a Balancer fork whose exitPool() never checks that the caller is the position holder or an approved relayer of it. The attacker called exitPool naming another holder as the sender, burning 850,000,000 of that holder\u2019s BZR pool tokens and receiving the corresponding 392.37 WETH and 880,539,680 rYOLO.",
