    "confidence": "high",
    "notes": "The whole loss is in the single exploit transaction, which is a contract creation whose constructor performs the exit. The vault 0xefb4e3cc438ef2854727a7df0d0baf844484edab pays out exactly 392.368916281212373207 WETH and 880539680.680963671973966099 rYOLO to the attacker contract while 850,000,000 BZR pool tokens are burned from the holder 0xb66585c4e460d49154d50325ce60adc44bc900e9. DefiLlama has no price series for rYOLO, so that component is recorded in quantity only and the USD total counts the WETH leg alone, which makes the figure a floor. WETH on Blast is priced through the DefiLlama ETH series. Nothing was recovered."
